The comparison shows simplified controls inside the purpose built robot taxi. Manual overrides

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:30.460
and physical switches are reduced relative to current model 3 and y layouts. The design choices

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:37.000
reflect expected unsupervised operation without a driver present. Owners are discussing how these

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:42.780
changes might influence future consumer vehicle interiors. The breakdown was published on

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:50.780
noteslaapp.com on June 30th. The same cost-pressure driving aluminum adoption is also pushing research

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:59.100
into entirely new battery chemistries. Cat EL and a Volkswagen-backed supplier report 175 watt-hour

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:05.760
per kilogram sales priced at roughly 5.1 cents per watt hour. The chemistry avoids lithium

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:12.380
and nickel-price swings while claiming comparable density to certain 4680 sales. Volume production

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:18.520
timelines and vehicle-level validation remain the next hurdles. Cheaper sales could help expand

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:25.280
charging infrastructure. Tesla has already begun rolling out higher-power units abroad. Initial

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:32.900
units are live in one market with peak power above prior V3 and V4 ratings. Site selection targets

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:39.140
long-distance travel corridors. Operators will monitor thermal performance and session times under

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:45.240
sustained high loads. Infrastructure growth supports new market entries, including Tesla's next

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:51.960
