00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:58.140
Local infrastructure and regulatory approvals are still being finalized. First customer

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:04.020
deliveries depend on those remaining steps. There is a challenge worth discussing. Theft of high

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:10.160
voltage packs from parked Teslas is rising in multiple regions. The incidents create long repair

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:16.900
weights and high replacement costs. Part scarcity and specialized labor requirements extend downtime

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:23.920
beyond typical collision repairs. Tesla is evaluating reinforced mounting hardware and tracking systems.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:30.340
Though widespread adoption timelines remain unclear. Owners in affected areas are adding after

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:36.580
market security while waiting for factory solutions. Material substitution and high-voltage wiring

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:42.480
and structural elements follows a straightforward cost and supply logic. Copper prices have

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:48.820
historically driven volatility in automotive bills of materials. Aluminium offers a lower and

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:55.260
more stable alternative once conductivity and corrosion requirements are met. Tesla began this

00:08:55.260 --> 00:09:01.420
transition earlier than most peers and Ferrari and BMW are now aligning on the same path.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:07.640
The move directly reduces exposure to one commodity while requiring updated joining processes

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:13.380
and thermal management calculations inside the vehicle. The practical limit appears in weight

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:19.540
sensitive areas where aluminium's lower conductivity forces thicker sections or additional cooling.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:25.460
Manufacturers must therefore decide where the cost saving outweighs any efficiency penalty

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:31.980
and where copper remains the better engineering choice. Early data from Tesla's fleet will show whether

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:37.440
real-world durability matches laboratory projections under varied climates and duty cycles.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:44.120
If the substitution holds, gross margin on each vehicle improves without requiring changes to

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:49.420
